bility, Gateway, short- and long-term memory, identity controls, and integrations between Spring AI and AgentCore.</p></details><div class="lineup-portraits"><div class="lineup-pop-portrait" data-speaker="Vadym Kazulkin"><span aria-hidden="true" data-portrait-glow="" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[color:color-mix(in_oklab,var(--violet-deep)_55%,var(--foreground))] opacity-20 blur-xl"></span><span class="lineup-portrait-circle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_65%,#4e0abb,transparent_75%)] opacity-30"></span></span><div class="lineup-portrait-crop"><img src="speakers/kazulkin.webp" srcSet="speakers/responsive/kazulkin-368.webp 368w, speakers/responsive/kazulkin-736.webp 736w, speakers/kazulkin.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 150px, 177px" alt="Vadym Kazulkin" loading="lazy" width="1100" height="1320"/></div></div></div></div></li><li id="talk-1215" tabindex="-1" class="lineup-session group/session scroll-mt-28 focus-visible:outline-none" data-kind="talk" data-has-portrait="true" data-compact="false"><div class="lineup-time"><time dateTime="12:15">12:15</time><span class="lineup-end"><span class="sr-only"> to </span><span aria-hidden="true">— </span><time dateTime="12:45">12:45</time></span></div><div class="lineup-panel [&amp;:has(&gt;details:not([open]))]:pb-0! group-focus-visible/session:outline-2 group-focus-visible/session:outline-offset-4 group-focus-visible/session:outline-primary"><span aria-hidden="true" data-border-shine="" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px z-[2] rounded-[inherit] opacity-55 [box-shadow:inset_0_0_1px_0.8px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--violet-deep)_60%,var(--foreground))] [mask-image:linear-gradient(var(--border-shine-angle,-35deg),#ffffff80,#ffffff30_30%_60%,#fff)]"></span><div class="lineup-topic"><h4>Real-Time Analytics for the AI Agent Era: Building an Agent-Ready Data Platform with StarRocks on AWS</h4></div><div class="lineup-speak