sform motion-safe:duration-150"><path d="M11.9999 13.1714L16.9497 8.22168L18.3639 9.63589L11.9999 15.9999L5.63599 9.63589L7.0502 8.22168L11.9999 13.1714Z"></path></svg><span class="group-open/talk:hidden">About this talk</span><span class="hidden group-open/talk:inline">Hide description</span><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Decoupling Serverless Systems: Building Resilient Architectures with AWS SNS and SQS</span></summary><p class="max-w-[68ch] pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Decouple serverless applications and handle high-volume traffic with Amazon SNS and SQS. Learn pub/sub and fanout messaging patterns, along with dead-letter queues and FIFO ordering for more resilient systems.</p></details><div class="lineup-portraits"><div class="lineup-pop-portrait" data-speaker="Shamshod Isaev"><span aria-hidden="true" data-portrait-glow="" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[color:color-mix(in_oklab,var(--violet-deep)_55%,var(--foreground))] opacity-20 blur-xl"></span><span class="lineup-portrait-circle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_65%,#4e0abb,transparent_75%)] opacity-30"></span></span><div class="lineup-portrait-crop"><img src="speakers/isaev.webp" srcSet="speakers/responsive/isaev-368.webp 368w, speakers/responsive/isaev-736.webp 736w, speakers/isaev.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 150px, 177px" alt="Shamshod Isaev" loading="lazy" width="1100" height="1320"/></div></div></div></div></li><li id="talk-1550" tabindex="-1" class="lineup-session group/session scroll-mt-28 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary" data-kind="lightning" data-has-portrait="true" data-compact="true"><span aria-hidden="true" data-border-shine="" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px z-[2] rounded-[inherit] opacity-55 [box-shadow:inset_0_0_1px_0.8px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--violet-deep)_60%,var(--foreground))] [mask-image:linear-