50"><path d="M11.9999 13.1714L16.9497 8.22168L18.3639 9.63589L11.9999 15.9999L5.63599 9.63589L7.0502 8.22168L11.9999 13.1714Z"></path></svg><span class="group-open/talk:hidden">About this talk</span><span class="hidden group-open/talk:inline">Hide description</span><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Resiliency meets data residency: How Bank CenterCredit hosts highly available workloads on AWS Outposts</span></summary><p class="max-w-[68ch] pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Explore how Bank CenterCredit built a hybrid platform on AWS Outposts across two geographically separated data centres. Learn how containerized banking applications and databases stay local, integrate with AWS Region services, and support high availability and Kazakhstan&#x27;s data residency requirements.</p></details></div></li><li id="talk-1430" tabindex="-1" class="lineup-session group/session scroll-mt-28 focus-visible:outline-none" data-kind="talk" data-feature="hero" data-has-portrait="true" data-compact="false"><div class="lineup-time"><time dateTime="14:30">14:30</time><span class="lineup-end"><span class="sr-only"> to </span><span aria-hidden="true">— </span><time dateTime="15:15">15:15</time></span></div><div class="lineup-panel [&amp;:has(&gt;details:not([open]))]:pb-0! group-focus-visible/session:outline-2 group-focus-visible/session:outline-offset-4 group-focus-visible/session:outline-primary"><span aria-hidden="true" data-border-shine="" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px z-[2] rounded-[inherit] opacity-55 [box-shadow:inset_0_0_1px_0.8px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--violet-deep)_60%,var(--foreground))] [mask-image:linear-gradient(var(--border-shine-angle,-35deg),#ffffff80,#ffffff30_30%_60%,#fff)]"></span><div class="lineup-topic"><span class="lineup-distinction"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="remixicon "><path d="M12 6.99999C16.4183 6.99999 20 10.5817 20 15C20 19.4