talk:hidden">About this talk</span><span class="hidden group-open/talk:inline">Hide description</span><span class="sr-only">: <!-- -->Pure Terraform setup for Enterprise on AWS and how AI can help</span></summary><p class="max-w-[68ch] pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Build enterprise infrastructure across AWS accounts and regions with native Terraform. Learn provider and assume-role patterns, variable organization and repository structures without wrappers or custom scripts, and explore how AI can help.</p></details><div class="lineup-portraits"><div class="lineup-pop-portrait" data-speaker="Denis Astahov"><span aria-hidden="true" data-portrait-glow="" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[color:color-mix(in_oklab,var(--violet-deep)_55%,var(--foreground))] opacity-20 blur-xl"></span><span class="lineup-portrait-circle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_65%,#4e0abb,transparent_75%)] opacity-30"></span></span><div class="lineup-portrait-crop"><img src="speakers/astahov.webp" srcSet="speakers/responsive/astahov-368.webp 368w, speakers/responsive/astahov-736.webp 736w, speakers/astahov.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 150px, 177px" alt="Denis Astahov" loading="lazy" width="1100" height="1320"/></div></div></div></div></li><li class="lineup-lightning-group"><div class="lineup-lightning-heading"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="remixicon "><path d="M13 10H20L11 23V14H4L13 1V10Z"></path></svg><span>Lightning talks</span><span class="lineup-lightning-range">15:30<!-- --> — <!-- -->16:00</span></div><ol class="lineup-lightning-grid" aria-label="Afternoon lightning talks"><li id="talk-1530" tabindex="-1" class="lineup-session group/session scroll-mt-28 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary" data-kind="lightning" data-has-portrait="true" data-compact="true"><span aria-hidden="true" data-border-shine="" class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-px z-[2] rounded-[inherit] opacity-55 [box-shadow:inset_0_0_1px_0.8px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--violet-deep)_60%,var(--foreground))] [mask-image:linear-gradient(var(--border-shine-angle,-35deg),#ffffff80,#ffffff30_30%_60%,#fff)]"></span><div class="lineup-time"><time dateTime="15:30">15:30</time><span class="lineup-end"><span class="sr-only"> to </span><span aria-hidden="true">— </span><time dateTime="15:40">15:40</time></span></div><div class="lineup-panel [&amp;:has(&gt;details:not([open]))]:pb-0! "><div class="lineup-topic"><span class="lineup-lightning"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="remixicon "><path d="M13 10H20L11 23V14H4L13 1V10Z"></path></svg>Lightning talk</span><h4>How I Fixed Two Dashboard Disasters for Under $10 a Month</h4></div><div class="lineup-speakers"><div class="lineup-speaker"><p class="lineup-speaker-name"><a href="index.html#speaker-aziza-isroilova" aria-label="View Aziza Isroilova&#x27;s speaker card" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-sm text-inherit underline decoration-dotted decoration-current/50 underline-offset-4 hover:text-coral hover:decoration-coral/50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary">Aziza Isroilova</a></p><p class="lineup-affiliation">Data Engineer, EPAM Systems</p></div></div><details class="group/talk col-span-full mt-5 min-w-0 border-t border-current/10"><summary class="flex min-h-14 w-fit cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold text-coral hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-primary [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" clas